@define name @lastname@, @firstname@
@define xdate @month@/@day@/@year@
NAME:         @name@
DATE:         @xdate@
SEMESTER:     @semester@
LIST OF COURSES:
@;
@comment  The original next line referred to NCOURSES (which is set a priori
@comment  to 3).  But we can do better, since @LIST@ returns the list size.
@;
@for i 1 @courses@
         @i@.   @{courses[@{i}]}
@next i
